cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "HRAgents: a virtual HR team for the HR department of one"
abstract: >-
  HRAgents is a self-hostable, open-source multi-agent system for small HR teams.
  LLM agents extract structured evidence from documents; a hand-specified deterministic
  function scores it; every consequential decision is gated by a named human; and every
  step lands on a hash-chained audit log.
